# workspace-backup-files — the mirror set, one list for both halves.
# Consumed by scripts/sync-workspace-backup (copy) and
# scripts/check-backup-sync (drift gate). Paths relative to the workspace
# root; `docs/...` and `scripts/...` keep their prefix in the mirror.
#
# Why this list exists (decision: PLAN_S4_BACKLOG_2026-10-14.md execution
# log, "copy as backup"): the workspace root is not a git repo, so these
# files have no version control at the root. They are mirrored into
# emthin/workspace-backup/ (a git checkout) — copy, never move: every
# link, gate and invocation assumes they live at the root.

